{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026TASyhC24Os1794354430.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>阿里巴巴旗下晶片製造部門平頭哥，已申請在本港上市。</p><p></p><p>阿里巴巴發公告指，9月已向港交所以保密形式遞表，分拆旗下平頭哥獨立上市，首次公開招股規模並未確定。早前有報道引述消息指，平頭哥計劃明年來港上市，目標集資20億至30億美元、折合約156億至234億港元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T00:49:34.270756+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T23:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T00:19:41.152373+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T00:42:59.019012+00:00","content_hash":"c3de7f03fd8776c37b204ba745a8c69f2980c8d04f339073e2dd8b9d4088ef3a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T00:49:34.270756+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}